    "turn_text": "I've come to appreciate how important rural issues are, how important It is to have a 50 state farm policy. How important it is to make sure that our farmers have what they need to succeed, because food is everything. It sounds pretty simple to say that, but it really is. I mean, we need food, and I look at it as a national security issue as well. I want to grow more here in the United States. I want to rely on more of food that has grown here in the United States. And I've made it a personal priority of mine to deal with this issue of food insecurity and hunger. uh... and the american farmer is essential to us solving hunger in this country",
