    "turn_text": "well the chairman said that you know his goal is just to do a talk to bottom review of the program uh... but uh... i'm a little suspicious uh... Because all the hearings that we have done on SNAP have kind of concluded the same thing, and that is that this is an important program that by and large is run efficiently, has a relatively low fraud rate as compared to other federal programs, and is a program that is essential. Charities can't pick up the slack. We need a strong SNAP program. I think we've also learned that the SNAP benefit is",
